@startuml Secuencia_CU010_Codigo_MOPGIMED
title "Diagrama de Secuencia — CU010 (fiel al código)\nVisualizar Semáforo de Stock · RF-010 · MOPGIMED"

skinparam {
  backgroundColor    #FFFFFF
  shadowing          false
  defaultFontName    Segoe UI
  defaultFontSize    10
  defaultFontColor   #1E293B
  ArrowColor         #B91C1C
  ArrowThickness     1.5
  ArrowFontSize      9
  ArrowFontColor     #475569
}

skinparam actor {
  BorderColor        #B91C1C
  BackgroundColor    #FFF1F2
  FontColor          #7F1D1D
  FontStyle          Bold
  FontSize           11
}

skinparam participant {
  BorderColor        #1D4ED8
  BackgroundColor    #EFF6FF
  FontColor          #1E3A8A
  FontSize           10
}

skinparam database {
  BorderColor        #065F46
  BackgroundColor    #ECFDF5
  FontColor          #064E3B
  FontSize           10
}

actor "Usuario (Jefatura / Logística)" as User
participant "ControlInventario.jsx\n(Frontend React)" as View
participant "api.js\n(Servicio Frontend)" as API
participant "inventarioController.js\n(Controlador Backend)" as Ctrl
participant "inventarioModel.js\n(Modelo BD)" as Model
database "MySQL\n(medicamentos)" as DB

User -> View : 1. Navega a /inventario
View -> API : 2. useEffect() dispara getInventario()
API -> Ctrl : 3. HTTP GET /api/inventario
Ctrl -> Model : 4. Promise.all([findAll(), getTotales()])
Model -> DB : 5. SELECT id, codigo, stock, stock_min, estado...
DB --> Model : 6. Retorna array de resultados
Model --> Ctrl : 7. Retorna { medicamentos, totals }
Ctrl -> API : 8. res.json(data)
API --> View : 9. Devuelve { medicamentos, totals }
View -> View : 10. setMedicamentos(data.medicamentos)\nsetTotals(data.totals)
View -> View : 11. map() y filter() por estado\n('Crítico', 'Bajo', 'Normal')
View --> User : 12. Renderiza UI (Tarjetas stats y tabla con badges)
@enduml
